%% Convención: CODE = símbolo resoluble del repositorio | EXT = actor/sistema externo | CONCEPT = estado o decisión conceptual
%% Fuentes: Defaul/ClassGestorSesion.vb | Services/Login/SegundoFactor/SecondFactorPreAuthenticationService.vb | Services/Login/SegundoFactor/SecondFactorAuthenticationService.vb | Modelo/Login/SegundoFactor/SegundoFactorInterfaces.vb | Infrastructure/Login/SegundoFactor/Diagnostics/TraceSecondFactorDiagnosticSink.vb | webservice/WebServiceLoginSegundoFactor.asmx.vb
%% Referencias CODE: CODE:ClassGestorSesion.InicioAplicacionWebGestorDocumental | CODE:SecondFactorPreAuthenticationService.Execute | CODE:ISecondFactorAuthenticationService.Start | CODE:SecondFactorAuthenticationService.Start | CODE:ISecondFactorChallengeRepository.Create | CODE:ISecondFactorEmailSender.Send | CODE:ISecondFactorChallengeRepository.MarkSent | CODE:IPendingSecondFactorContextStore.Save | CODE:ISecondFactorDiagnosticSink.Record | CODE:WebServiceLoginSegundoFactor.ObtenerEstado | CODE:ISecondFactorAuthenticationService.GetStatus
sequenceDiagram
actor Browser as EXT Cliente WebForms
participant Login as CODE ClassGestorSesion
participant Pre as CODE SecondFactorPreAuthenticationService
participant Auth as CODE SecondFactorAuthenticationService
participant Repo as CODE ISecondFactorChallengeRepository
participant Mail as CODE ISecondFactorEmailSender
participant Store as CODE IPendingSecondFactorContextStore
participant Diag as CODE ISecondFactorDiagnosticSink
participant Api as CODE WebServiceLoginSegundoFactor
Browser->>Login: InicioAplicacionWebGestorDocumental(modulo: String, user: String, passs: String, nombre_empresa: String): String
Login->>Pre: Execute(request: SecondFactorPreAuthenticationRequest): SecondFactorPreAuthenticationResult
alt 2FA desactivado
  Pre-->>Login: FINALIZED por finalizador legacy
else 2FA activo
  Pre->>Auth: Start(request: SecondFactorAuthenticationStartRequest): SecondFactorAuthenticationResult
  Auth->>Diag: Record(correlationId: Guid, stage: SecondFactorDiagnosticStage, outcome: SecondFactorDiagnosticOutcome): Void
  Auth->>Repo: Create(challenge, protectedCode, sessionBindingHash)
  alt creación o envío falla
    Auth-->>Pre: fallo cerrado, Session limpia
  else envío correcto
    Auth->>Mail: Send(message)
    Auth->>Repo: MarkSent(challengeId, sentAtUtc)
    Auth->>Store: Save(context)
    Auth->>Diag: Record(correlationId, PENDING_CONTEXT_SAVE, SUCCEEDED)
    Auth-->>Pre: SECOND_FACTOR_REQUIRED
  end
end
Browser->>Api: ObtenerEstado(): SegundoFactorEstadoDto
Api->>Auth: GetStatus(): SecondFactorAuthenticationResult
Auth-->>Api: pendiente o sesión inválida
Api-->>Browser: DTO saneado
